Spec: SpecDD Create File Quick Fix

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Create missing files or directories for unresolved exact SpecDD path references.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDCreateFileQuickFix.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDCreateFileQuickFix.kt

Can read:
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/references/*

Must:
  Implement an IntelliJ intention action.
  Be available only when the target path is inside the project root.
  Be available only when the target path does not already exist.
  Create missing parent directories for nested exact paths.
  Create file-like targets as files.
  Create directory-like targets as directories.
  Create the path inside an IntelliJ write action when an application is available.
  Refresh the local VFS entry after path creation when an application is available.
  Use action text `Create file '<path>'` for file-like targets.
  Use action text `Create directory '<path>'` for directory-like targets.

Must not:
  Create paths outside the project root.
  Execute created files or referenced files.
  Create symbols.
